{"id":"tuyau","lemma":"tuyau","pos":"noun","rank":2230,"glosses":["pipe","tube","insider tip"],"ipa":"/tɥi.jo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/Fr-tuyau.ogg/Fr-tuyau.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tuyaux"},"formAudio":{"tuyaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-tuyaux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Du gaz semble s'échapper du tuyau.","en":"Gas seems to be escaping from the pipe.","words":[{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"gas"},{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to escape , evade"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Il y a des tuyaux sous le sol.","en":"There are pipes running under the flooring.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"soil, earth"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Le tuyau d'eau fuit.","en":"That water pipe leaks.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to escape","l":"fuir"}]},{"text":"J'ai reçu un tuyau anonyme.","en":"I got an anonymous tip.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"anonymous"}]},{"text":"Elle lui donna quelques tuyaux sur la prononciation.","en":"She gave him a few pointers on pronunciation.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"pronunciation"}]}]}